{"version":"1.0.0","enabled":true,"name":"eve-sdl-win-precheck","description":"Legacy (pre-1.0 IDE) twin of eve-sdl-win-precheck.json. Windows-only SDL prerequisite check (WARNING, non-blocking) on promptSubmit (pre-1.0 has no SessionStart trigger, same fallback as eve-sdl-preflight.kiro.hook). Runs under bun (native on Windows, fires even without a POSIX shell); if git is missing on Windows it prints an install directive for Git for Windows. Silent no-op on macOS/Linux and when git is present.","when":{"type":"promptSubmit"},"then":{"type":"runCommand","command":"bun .kiro/hooks/eve-sdl-win-precheck.ts"}}
